<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Total inside merchandise and fuel gross profit
increased 14.0% year-over-year on a same-store basis, reflecting growth in both fuel and inside merchandise categories.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Fuel gallons sold increased 1.4% year-over-year
on a same-store basis, and same-store fuel gross profit increased 29.0% year-over-year.</P>

